  offensiveStat: 0
  defensiveStat: 2
  basePower: 7
  weakSuccessLines:
  - There it is. I see your fear.
  - Your courage falters.
  - You feel it now.
  - Your footing weakens.
  strongSuccessLines:
  - You are already beaten.
  - Your will bends.
  - The bridge rejects you.
  - Leave while you can.
  criticalSuccessLines:
  - You were never my equal.
  - Your spirit cracks.
  - The toll is the least of your worries.
  - Begone.
  weakFailureLines:
  - You would be wise to reconsider.
  - This bridge is not forgiving.
  - You test dangerous ground.
  - You stand before power.
  strongFailureLines:
  - Kneel, or be broken!
  - I will snap your courage in half!
  - You stand one breath from ruin!
  - Defy me again and regret it!
  criticalFailureLines:
  - "You will kneel before\u2014 \u2026oh."
  - "Fear me! \u2026No? Truly?"
  - "I am doom given flesh! \u2026Why are you laughing?"
  - You should be terrified. This is terrifying.
